  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Detta planeringsbidrag g&#xf6;r det m&#xf6;jligt att skapa ett samarbete mellan f&#xf6;retagen Red Lion Holding AB och CMC Soft i Vietnam, d&#xe4;r den f&#xf6;rstn&#xe4;mnda verkar som en agent i Europa ansvarig f&#xf6;r att introducera konsumenter f&#xf6;r CMC Soft&apos;s avdelning f&#xf6;r outsourcing.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The PDC Planning Grant will enable for initial business partnership between Red Lion Holding AB as an agent in Europe responsible for bringing in customers for CMC Soft&apos;s outsourcing division in Vietnam.</narrative>
  </description>
